Package: easyview
Version: 1.0.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libvlc5 (>= 3.0.0), libgl1, libxkbcommon0, libdbus-1-3, libxcb-xinerama0, libfontconfig1, libglib2.0-0
Recommends: libvlc-bin
Maintainer: EasyVIEW Maintainers <maintainer@example.com>
Description: Lightweight video surveillance preview client
 A minimal desktop client for RTSP/HTTP-HLS camera preview. Features:
  * Camera management (IP/port/user/pass) with edit/delete/connection test
  * Auto split layouts by window count (uniform / 1 big + N small), up to 64 channels preview
  * Multi-vendor RTSP URL templates + custom stream URI (HTTP/HLS)
  * Connection diagnosis (timeout / refused / auth / bad address / no stream)
  * Cross-platform (Windows / Linux)
